## twitter-cldr-rb

TwitterCLDR is a Ruby implementation of the ICU (International Components for Unicode) that uses the CLDR (Common Locale Data Repository) to format dates, plurals, and more.

> [!WARNING]
> This repository is no longer maintained and has moved to [ruby-i18n/twitter-cldr-rb](https://github.com/ruby-i18n/twitter-cldr-rb). Please file all new issues, pull requests, discussions, etc against the new repo.
